msgid ""
"快速开始\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Quick Start\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文面向 Ascend NPU 环境，提供基于 GSM8K 和 Qwen3-0.6B 的最小化 GRPO 训练验证流程，涵盖四种训推后端组合，帮助用户快速上手。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This article is intended for the Ascend NPU environment. It provides a minimal GRPO training and validation process based on GSM8K and Qwen3-0.6B. This process covers four training and inference backend combinations to help you get started quickly.\n"
""

msgid ""
"验证范围：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Verification scope:\n"
""

msgid ""
"配置提示：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Configuration tips:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 默认配置：示例脚本均使用 Qwen3-0.6B 模型和 GSM8K 数据集。\n"
"- 硬件适配：由于 A3 每卡含 2 Die，运行示例需将 ``n_gpus_per_node`` 参数设置为16（A2 每卡含 1 die）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Default configuration: The sample scripts use the Qwen3-0.6B model and the GSM8K dataset.\n"
"- Hardware adaptation: Because each A3 card contains 2 dies, set the ``n_gpus_per_node`` parameter to 16 to run the sample (each A2 card contains 1 die)\n"
""

msgid ""
"环境准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Environment Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"权重准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Weight Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 Qwen3-0.6B 模型权重。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the Qwen3-0.6B model weights from Hugging Face on your own.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 脚本中的默认读取权重路径为 ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``，建议将权重放在该路径下。若路径不同请修改脚本中的MODEL_PATH指向本地路径。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. The default path for loading weights in the script is ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``. We recommend placing the weights in this path. If you use a different path, modify MODEL_PATH in the script to point to your local path.\n"
""

msgid ""
"数据准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Data Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 GSM8K 原始数据集。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the raw GSM8K dataset from Hugging Face yourself.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 执行以下命令（请根据实际数据集路径调整命令）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Run the following command (adjust the command based on the actual dataset path)\n"
""

msgid ""
"   生成如下文件：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   The following files are generated:\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行方式\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Running method\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 进入项目目录： ``cd /your/path/verl``。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Enter the project directory: ``cd /your/path/verl``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 使能CANN环境：执行以下命令。（若您自定义了 CANN 的路径，请根据实际路径调整命令。）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Enable the CANN environment: Run the following command. (If you customized the CANN path, adjust the command based on the actual path.)\n"
""

msgid ""
"3. 运行脚本：当前提供四种常用训推后端组合，请参考以下表格选择对应脚本：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"3. Run the script: Currently, four common training and inference backend combinations are available. Refer to the following table to select the corresponding script:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   * - 组合\n"
"     - 训练后端\n"
"     - rollout 后端\n"
"     - 运行方式\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   * - Combination\n"
"     - Training backend\n"
"     - Rollout backend\n"
"     - Running method\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""

msgid ""
"脚本内具体参数说明详见 `训练配置参数与指标说明 <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For detailed descriptions of the parameters in the script, refer to `Training Configuration Parameters and Metrics Description <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"多节点任务拉起详见 `多机任务拉起操作指南 <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For details about multi-node task startup, refer to the `Multi-Machine Task Startup Operation Guide <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_.\n"
""

