msgid ""
"SGLang 后端使能说明\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"SGLang Backend Enablement Guide\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前 verl 已解析推理常见参数，详见 `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_ 中 ``ServerArgs`` 初始化传参。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"verl currently parses common inference parameters. For details, see the ``ServerArgs`` initialization parameters in `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"其他 `SGLang 参数 <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ 均可通过 ``engine_kwargs`` 进行参数传递。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"You can pass all other `SGLang arguments <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ using ``engine_kwargs``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"vLLM 后端脚本转换为 SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Converting vLLM backend scripts to SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"如需自行将 vLLM 后端推理脚本转换为 SGLang，需要添加或修改以下参数。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"To manually convert the vLLM backend inference script to SGLang, add or modify the following parameters.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 必须\n"
"   actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   # Required\n"
"   actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 可选\n"
"   # 使能推理 EP，详细使用方法见：\n"
"   # https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README.md\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   # Optional\n"
"   # Enable inference EP. For detailed usage, see:\n"
"   # https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README.md\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 2026/06/30：新增覆盖四种常用训推后端组合，便于用户在 quickstart 阶段快速选择合适的启动脚本。\n"
"- 2026/05/13：将 quick start 和 install guidance 分开。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- 2026/06/30: Added coverage of four common training and inference backend combinations to help users quickly select an appropriate startup script during the quickstart phase.\n"
"- 2026/05/13: Separated the quick start and install guidance.\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 环境入口：verl 入口是否可用；\n"
"- 数据读取：GSM8K数据集是否正确解析；\n"
"- 组件初始化：actor、rollout、reference worker 是否能初始化；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Environment entry: whether the verl entry point is available;\n"
"- Data reading: whether the GSM8K dataset is correctly parsed;\n"
"- Component initialization: whether the actor, rollout, and reference worker can be initialized;\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行本文脚本前，测试测试请确认已完成 verl Ascend 环境安装。环境安装详见 `昇腾安装指南 <./install_guidance.rst>`_ 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before running the scripts in this document, ensure that you have completed the verl Ascend environment installation. For environment installation details, see `Ascend Installation Guide <./install_guidance.rst>`_ .\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # MoE 模型多 DP 时必须设置为 True（默认为False）\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\   \n"
""
msgstr ""
"   # Must be set to True for MoE models with multiple DP (default is False)\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\\n"
""
